          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alamdog bino miyo acel me mot me bal, acel me mot awaŋa; alamdog bino tiyo tic me kwanyo bal i kome kittono i nyim Rwot pi remo ame obedo cwer i kome te miyo en bedo ŋat a cik ogeŋo.",
          "type": "text",
